// fitted on BTC/USD 2020-01-01 .. labels before 2026-01-01). w[0] = intercept, w[1..17] with mu / sd of the
// 17 inputs, in this order: zone, dist, side, r1, r5, r20, vol, age, zone_vol, dist_vol, fdir, fL1, fS1, fL2, fS2, fL4, fS4.
